//============================================================================
//Rule : Endpoint - Defender - Malicious File Download Detected
//MITRE : T1204.001 (User Execution: Malicious File)
//Data Source : DeviceEvents (MDE)
//Prerequisite : MDE onboarded, DeviceEvents connector enabled in Sentinel
//Type : 偵測 Defender 攔截到的惡意檔案下載或執行
//Severity : HIGH - 使用者被 ClickFix 誘導下載並執行惡意 payload
//Known FP : 合法安全性測試工具被誤判
//Tuning : 關聯後續 DeviceNetworkEvents 確認 C2 是否上線
//Fix (2026-11) : 移除 AntivirusScanCompleted（掃描完成通知，不是偵測事件）；
//         移除威脅名稱關鍵字（demon/sliver/trojan/malware）過濾——原寫法只會命中本 lab 的樣本，
//         會漏掉 HackTool:/Ransom:/Backdoor: 等其他家族；改為全部 AntivirusDetection 並解析 ThreatName
//============================================================================
DeviceEvents
| where ActionType == "AntivirusDetection"
| extend Fields = parse_json(AdditionalFields)
| extend ThreatName = tostring(Fields.ThreatName),
         WasRemediated = tostring(Fields.WasRemediated)
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    DeviceName,
    InitiatingProcessAccountName,
    FileName,
    FolderPath,
    ThreatName,
    WasRemediated,
    AdditionalFields
| sort by TimeGenerated desc
